und","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Conqueror of the land, whose pen has not marked the ceremonial deed. The responsibility that he and his sister must carry has yet to come, a fact that their crown constantly reminds them of.","abilities":["First Form","[Twins] The closer Theresis and Theresa are, the more damage they deal, and the less Arts and Physical damage they take.","[Brandish] Unleashes a sword wave in a direction after charging up, dealing Physical damage to all allied units in its path.","[Guardian] Periodically attempts to significantly restore Theresa, Black Crowned Sage's SP by launching an energy sphere, which deals massive Arts damage to the first allied unit that it collides with.","Second Form","[Gemini] The closer Theresis and Theresa are, the less Physical and Arts damage they take, and the faster Theresa, Black Crowned Sage's SP recovers.","[Reshape Will] Drains a significant amount of Objective HP after an extended duration into battle.","When your mind is Fractured, defeating Theresis, Black Crowned Lord summons several elite enemies."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.35,"stats":{"hp":120000,"atk":1800,"def":2000,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.8}},"sarkaz_royal_court_elite_soldier":{"slug":"sarkaz_royal_court_elite_soldier","name":"Sarkaz Royal Court Elite Soldier","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Royal Court Elite Soldier.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"An elite soldier of the Sarkaz Royal Court. Under Manfred's training, they are not only more formidable warriors, but also more professional.","abilities":["Attacks deal Necrosis"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":5500,"atk":380,"def":280,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"deathv